    {
      "source": "Factory bean that facilitates creation of Redis-based collections. Supports list, set, zset (or sortedSet), map (or\nhash) and properties. Uses the key and <a href=\"RedisCollectionFactoryBean.CollectionType.html\" title=\"enum class in org.springframework.data.redis.support.collections\"><code>RedisCollectionFactoryBean.CollectionType</code></a> to determine what collection type to use. The factory\nverifies the key type if a <a href=\"RedisCollectionFactoryBean.CollectionType.html\" title=\"enum class in org.springframework.data.redis.support.collections\"><code>RedisCollectionFactoryBean.CollectionType</code></a> is specified. Defaults to <a href=\"RedisCollectionFactoryBean.CollectionType.html#LIST\"><code>RedisCollectionFactoryBean.CollectionType.LIST</code></a>.",
      "translation": "这是一个用于创建基于 Redis 的集合的工厂 Bean。它支持列表、集合、有序集合（或 sortedSet）、映射（或 hash）以及属性。该工厂使用键和<a href=\"RedisCollectionFactoryBean.CollectionType.html\" title=\"enum class in org.springframework.data.redis.support.collections\"><code>RedisCollectionFactoryBean.CollectionType</code></a>来确定要使用的集合类型。如果指定了<a href=\"RedisCollectionFactoryBean.CollectionType.html\" title=\"enum class in org.springframework.data.redis.support.collections\"><code>RedisCollectionFactoryBean.CollectionType</code></a>，该工厂将验证键的类型。默认值为<a href=\"RedisCollectionFactoryBean.CollectionType.html#LIST\"><code>RedisCollectionFactoryBean.CollectionType.LIST</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Collection types supported by this factory.",
      "translation": "此工厂支持的集合类型。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
